    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cim-con kä Gadha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Cim-con wä kä Gadha, ɛn wi̱ni cuɛ ciek mi ler nɛn, kä cuɛ wä tɔ̱ɔ̱c kɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua ji̱ Gadha la̱r lär i̱, “Cim-con a wa̱nɛ.” Kä cukɛ gua̱a̱th go̱l liɛpkɛ jɛ kɛ wäär kɛɛliw thok rɛ̈ɛ̈k wec. Cukɛ rɔ pa̱l piny kɛ wäär kɛɛliw wä kɛ i̱, “Liɛp nɛ jɛ ɛn wääri amäni runwaŋ, banɛ jɛ ku näk.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cu Cim-con niɛɛn amäni wärdäär. Kä cuɛ keer kä cuɛ thi̱ek ni thuɔk rɛ̈ɛ̈k wec wuk kä cuɛ kap kɛ wääthnikiɛn kɛɛl kɛ gääknikiɛn cuɛ kɛ la̱th wukädɛ kä cuɛ kɛ kap ni wi̱i̱ pa̱a̱m mi na̱n mi te lotdä Ɣɛb-ron.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cim-con kɛnɛ Dɛ-li-la",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔr kä mɔmɔ cu Cim-con tekɛ nhök kɛ ciek mi cieŋ lo̱o̱lä Tho-rek, mi cɔal i̱ Dɛ-li-la. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt ben kä ciek kä cuɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Pɛlɛ, kä ŋäcni mɔ jak jɛ kä bum ɔ, kä dɔ̱ŋ derɛ tekɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱p mi tiam kɔ ni jɛ. Kä dɔ̱ŋ dëë kɔ jɛ yian a ba yak. Kä bi ramɔ ji̱ moc kä kɔ kɛ yio̱w ti bathdɔɔr wi̱cdɛ kuɔ̱r kɛl.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dɛ-li-la Cim-con jiök i̱, “Nyuth ni ɣä gua̱a̱th bumädu, kä dëë ji̱ yian i̱di, a dëë raan i̱ yak.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Cim-con ɛ loc i̱, “Mi ca ɣä yian kɛ dep guup da̱ŋ bärɔw ti pay ŋɔn, dëë kɔ̱a̱c a bä ce̱tnikɛ nɛy tin kɔ̱ŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt ɛ nöŋ dep bärɔw ti pay ŋɔn kä cuɛ jɛ yian kɛ kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ tëë kɛ wutni ti li̱p duëëlɛ. Kä cuɛ Cim-con jiök i̱, “Cim-con, ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt a bëë kä ji̱ ni!” Kä cuɛ dep puɔ̱t ce̱tnikɛ thiek mi ca pɛt ɛ mac. Inɔ /ka̱n luɔt bumädɛ jek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dɛ-li-la Cim-con jiök i̱, “Nɛnɛ, ci ɣä jak kä dɔ̱a̱r, ɛ kaŋi ni ɣä. Ɛn täämɛ bër kuɛ la̱r ɣä dëë ji̱ yian i̱di.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Cim-con ɛ loc i̱, “Mi ci kɛn ɣä yian kɛ dep ti /ka̱n kɔn yian, ɣän dëë kɔ̱a̱c a bä ce̱tnikɛ duɔth nath ti kɔ̱ŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cu Dɛ-li-la dep ti pay ŋɔn ka̱n kä cuɛ jɛ yian kɛ kɛ kä cuɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt tin, Cim-con!” Kä kɛn naath tekɛ li̱pä rɛy duëël. Duundɛ ɣöö cuɛ dep puɔ̱t ce̱tnikɛ lath tetnikɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dɛ-li-la Cim-con jiök i̱, “Mäni täämɛ jaki ɣä kä dɔ̱a̱r, a lätdi ni ɣä kac. Läri jɛ ɣä dëë ji̱ yian i̱di.” Kä cuɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Mi pi̱thi tak mieemkä da̱ŋ bärɔw ti̱ti̱ kɛ rɔk kä bikɛ pua̱t kɛ lo̱c. Ɣän bä kɔ̱a̱c, a bä ce̱tnikɛ nɛy tin kɔ̱kiɛn.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min cɛ niɛɛn, cu Dɛ-li-la tak mieem wecdɛ da̱ŋ bärɔw pith kɛ rɔk. Kä cuɛ kɛ pua̱t kɛ lo̱c, kä cuɛ Cim-con jiök i̱, “Ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt tin Cim-con!” Duundɛ ɣöö cuɛ keer ni̱n, cuɛ rɔk kɛnɛ lo̱c yuɔ̱t ni raar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ Cim-con jiök i̱, “Deri jɛ ku lɛ lar i̱, ‘Nhɔki ɣä i̱di,’ kä /ci lɔcdu te kä ɣä? Ci ɣä jak kä dɔ̱a̱r nikä diɔ̱ɔ̱k täämɛ, kä /keni ɣä la̱r gua̱a̱th in te buɔ̱mdu thi̱n.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Dɛ-li-la jɛ cuil ɛlɔ̱ŋ kɛ ruac ni ciaŋ, kä kokɛ jɛ, cuɛ gaak kɛ gak mi lia̱a̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ Dɛ-li-la la̱t lɔcdɛ kɛɛliw, jio̱kɛ jɛ i̱, “/Ken reet me̱t rët kɛ wi̱cdä. Kɛ ɣöö ca ɣä lëy Kuoth ni mëë dapkɛ ɣä. Mi ca wi̱cdä mut, dëë buɔ̱mdä jiɛɛn kä ɣä, a dëë ce̱tnikɛ nɛy tin kɔ̱kiɛn.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci Dɛ-li-la jɛ ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö ci Cim-con jɛ la̱t lɔcdɛ kɛɛliw, cuɛ kuäär ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt jäk kä ram mi wä jɛ cɔl, jio̱kɛ jɛ i̱, “Bër ni kä kɛɛl, kɛ ɣöö ci Cim-con ɣä la̱t lɔcdɛ kɛɛliw.” Kä cu kua̱r ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt ben kä Dɛ-li-la, a rɔamkɛ yio̱w kɛ rɔ̱ kɛɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dɛ-li-la Cim-con jak kä ni̱n buɔ̱ɔ̱rɛ. Kä cu Dɛ-li-la raan cɔl, kä cuɛ tak mieem wec Cim-con da̱ŋ bärɔw muɔ̱t raar. Kä cuɛ jɛ tok kɛ mi yaakɛ jɛ, kä cu buɔ̱mdɛ jiɛɛn kä jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wee, “Ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt tin Cim-con!” Kä cuɛ keer ni̱n, kä cuɛ wee, “Ɣän bä wä raar ce̱tkɛ ta̱a̱ in wen, a bä rɔ tɛŋ.” Kä /kui̱cɛ jɛ ɛn ɣöö ci Kuoth Nhial jiɛɛn kä jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt jɛ käp kä cua nyinkɛ ka̱m raar, kä cua jɛ naŋ kä Gadha, cua jɛ yian kɛ ciik yieethä min yian. Kä la ɣɔ̱tdɛ duëël yieenä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cu miem wecdɛ rɔ nyɔk kɛ do̱ny kɛ kɔr kä mëë ca wi̱cdɛ mut.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lia̱a̱ Cim-con",
          "type": "text"
        }
